Subject: vk: detect Qualcomm Adreno as its own driver vendor
Why: rpcs3 has no driver_vendor entry for Qualcomm, so every Adreno device
     (i.e. all Snapdragon Android handhelds) falls through to "unknown",
     logging "Unsupported device: Adreno (TM) 740" and "Unknown driver
     vendor!", and no vendor-specific path can ever apply to it. Add
     driver_vendor::ADRENO, detect it from VK_DRIVER_ID_QUALCOMM_PROPRIETARY /
     VK_DRIVER_ID_MESA_TURNIP (and by GPU name where driverID is unavailable),
     and give it arms in the existing vendor switches. Behavior for other
     vendors is unchanged; this is the prerequisite for adding real Adreno
     workarounds.
Upstream-status: candidate

diff --git a/rpcs3/Emu/RSX/VK/VKCompute.cpp b/rpcs3/Emu/RSX/VK/VKCompute.cpp
index 033e19f..7e7e3c3 100644
--- a/rpcs3/Emu/RSX/VK/VKCompute.cpp
+++ b/rpcs3/Emu/RSX/VK/VKCompute.cpp
@@ -58,7 +58,9 @@ namespace vk
 			case vk::driver_vendor::V3DV:
 			case vk::driver_vendor::PANVK:
 			case vk::driver_vendor::ARM_MALI:
-				// TODO: Actually bench this. Using 32 for now to match other common configurations.
+			case vk::driver_vendor::ADRENO:
+				// TODO: Actually bench this. Adreno waves are 64 or 128 wide depending on the
+				// shader, so 32 divides evenly; matches the other mobile configurations.
 			case vk::driver_vendor::DOZEN:
 				// Actual optimal size depends on the D3D device. Use 32 since it should work well on both AMD and NVIDIA
 			case vk::driver_vendor::NVIDIA:
diff --git a/rpcs3/Emu/RSX/VK/VKHelpers.cpp b/rpcs3/Emu/RSX/VK/VKHelpers.cpp
index 9360215..be0bb19 100644
--- a/rpcs3/Emu/RSX/VK/VKHelpers.cpp
+++ b/rpcs3/Emu/RSX/VK/VKHelpers.cpp
@@ -149,6 +149,9 @@ namespace vk
 		case driver_vendor::ARM_MALI:
 			// Needs more testing
 			break;
+		case driver_vendor::ADRENO:
+			// Qualcomm mobile GPUs; needs more testing
+			break;
 		default:
 			rsx_log.warning("Unsupported device: %s", gpu_name);
 		}
diff --git a/rpcs3/Emu/RSX/VK/VKRenderTargets.h b/rpcs3/Emu/RSX/VK/VKRenderTargets.h
index 7da26f3..557192a 100644
--- a/rpcs3/Emu/RSX/VK/VKRenderTargets.h
+++ b/rpcs3/Emu/RSX/VK/VKRenderTargets.h
@@ -189,6 +189,7 @@ namespace vk
 			case driver_vendor::HONEYKRISP:
 			case driver_vendor::PANVK:
 			case driver_vendor::ARM_MALI:
+			case driver_vendor::ADRENO:
 				break;
 			}
 
